#. <CLT 4>ボクが向かった先は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Where I headed first was...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんと一晩だけ交換した、
#. 自分の部屋…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...my room, where I'd let Sayaka stay for a single\n"
"night.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女が泊まったはずのボクの部屋…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Where she was supposed to be safe...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど、その部屋は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But over the course of that one night...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>一晩の内に…すっかり様変わりしていた……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...the room had been completely transformed.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. なんだよ、これ……！？
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wh-What the hell!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんなモニターなんかを
#. 気にしている場合じゃない！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't have time to think about this damn monitor!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな監視カメラを気にしている場合じゃない！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Now's no time to stare at some stupid surveillance\n"
"camera!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>何があったのか、詳しく調べないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to investigate and find out exactly what\n"
"happened here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクはシャワールームの中を覗き込んだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd better check the bathroom.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Let's...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>シャワールーム…の中……を……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...take...a...look...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>………ノ……ゾキ………コ………………………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...in...side...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…………………………………………………………………
#. …………………………………………………………………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>... ... ...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>自分が叫び声を上げていると気付くまでに、
#. しばらくの時間が必要だった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It took me a second to realize that I was screaming.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>目の前の光景は、
#. ボクのまぶたにしっかりと焼きつき…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What I saw dug its way through my eyes and buried\n"
"itself in my brain.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And then...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And then...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>……………………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…………………………………………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>... ... ...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…暗転。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...everything went black.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>壁や床に…刃物で斬り付けたような跡！？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are slashes and gouges on the walls and the\n"
"floor.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…それより舞園さんは！？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>More importantly, where's Sayaka!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…それより舞園さんは！？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>More importantly, where's Sayaka!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この粘着テープクリーナー…
#. いつの間にか、残量がかなり減ってる。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It looks like the lint roller has way less sheets than\n"
"it used to...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…それより舞園さんは！？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>More importantly, where's Sayaka!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>引き出しの中には工具セットが入っている。
#. 未開封のままだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The toolkit is still inside the drawer, and it's still\n"
"sealed.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>壁や床に…刃物や何かで斬り付けたような跡！？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are slashes and gouges on the walls and the\n"
"floor.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…それより舞園さんは！？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>More importantly, where's Sayaka!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって…
#. ボクが護身用に持ち帰ってきた金箔の模擬刀だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is...the replica sword I brought back for\n"
"self-defense.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>鞘から抜かれた“抜き身”の状態になってる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's been taken out of its sheath...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…それより舞園さんは！？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>More importantly, where's Sayaka!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって…
#. ボクが護身用に持ち帰ってきた金箔の模擬刀だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is...the replica sword I brought back for\n"
"self-defense.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>鞘から刀が抜かれて、
#. 鞘だけになっている…
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's the sheath for the replica sword. The sword\n"
"itself has been removed..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…それより舞園さんは！？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>More importantly, where's Sayaka!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>床にキーホルダーが落ちている…
#. ボクの名前のキーホルダーが付いた鍵だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a keychain on the ground... It has my name on\n"
"it, so this must be my room key.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>部屋を交換した時、
#. これは舞園さんに渡したんだったな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I gave it to Sayaka when we traded rooms...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ベッド…
#. これも荒らされてるな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The bed's been damaged, too...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>紙が張ってあったところ…
#. 傷ができてる？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is where that piece of paper was hanging. There's\n"
"a scratch here...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…それより舞園さんは！？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>More importantly, where's Sayaka!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>模擬刀が置いてあったスタンドだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's the display stand the sword was on...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…それより舞園さんは！？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>More importantly, where's Sayaka!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…舞園さんはどこだ！？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Where's Sayaka!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
